# Purpose: Save a bounded excerpt of the latest release failures for handoff.
# Inputs: release.log, oldest event first.
# Outputs: Up to three ERROR/FATAL lines on stdout and in release-errors.txt.
accept release_path as text with default "release.log"
run cat with path release_path
pipe to grep with flags ["-E"] and pattern "ERROR|FATAL"
pipe to tail with flags ["-n", "3"]
then save to "release-errors.txt"
